### =====================================================================
### Pruebas manuales de la API (extensión "REST Client" de VS Code)
###
### 1. Arranca la API:  pnpm docker:up  y luego  pnpm dev
### 2. Pulsa "Send Request" encima de cada petición, EN ORDEN.
###    Las peticiones con "@name" guardan su respuesta y las siguientes
###    reutilizan el token / id / código automáticamente.
###
### Si cambias el puerto (PORT en apps/api/.env), cámbialo aquí también.
### =====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@password = contraseña-segura


### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 0. Salud
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

GET {{baseUrl}}/health


### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Usuarios (la primera vez: register; las siguientes: 409 y usa login)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "cazador_demo", "password": "{{password}}" }

###

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "escapador_demo", "password": "{{password}}" }

###

# @name hunter
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "cazador_demo", "password": "{{password}}" }

###

# @name runner
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "escapador_demo", "password": "{{password}}" }

###

@hunterToken = {{hunter.response.body.accessToken}}
@runnerToken = {{runner.response.body.accessToken}}
@runnerId = {{runner.response.body.user.id}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{hunterToken}}


### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Sala
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# ¿Tengo ya una partida abierta? (si sí, ciérrala con la petición "Cerrar sala"
# o espera a que termine: solo se puede estar en una a la vez)
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches/current
Authorization: Bearer {{hunterToken}}

###

# @name createMatch
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches
Authorization: Bearer {{hunterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "playArea": { "lat": 41.387, "lng": 2.17, "radiusMeters": 400 },
  "hidingSeconds": 10,
  "durationSeconds": 120,
  "pingIntervalSeconds": 15
}

###

@matchId = {{createMatch.response.body.id}}
@joinCode = {{createMatch.response.body.joinCode}}

POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/join
Authorization: Bearer {{runnerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "joinCode": "{{joinCode}}" }

###

GET {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{matchId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{runnerToken}}

###

# Cambiar de equipo (solo el anfitrión). Pon "HUNTER" o "RUNNER".
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{matchId}}/players/{{runnerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hunterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "team": "RUNNER" }

###

# Empezar: WAITING -> HIDING (y a los 10 s, ACTIVE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{matchId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{hunterToken}}

###

# Mira cómo cambia status / hidingEndsAt / endsAt
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{matchId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hunterToken}}

###

# Cerrar sala (solo funciona ANTES de empezar)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{matchId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hunterToken}}


### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Errores esperados (para ver cómo responde)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# 401 UNAUTHORIZED: sin token
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches/current

###

# 400 VALIDATION_ERROR: con "details" por campo
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "a", "password": "1" }

###

# 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "cazador_demo", "password": "incorrecta" }

###

# 404 MATCH_NOT_FOUND
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/join
Authorization: Bearer {{runnerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "joinCode": "ZZZZZZ" }

###

# 403 NOT_HOST: el escapador intenta empezar
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/{{matchId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{runnerToken}}

###

# 400: id que no es UUID
GET {{baseUrl}}/matches/no-es-un-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{hunterToken}}


### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### La parte en tiempo real (posiciones, pings, capturas) va por WebSocket
### y no se puede probar desde aquí:  pnpm --filter @manhunt/api simulate
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
